 "notes": [
  "Gen 7 Doubles OU: under Trick Room, Floatzel's Surf knocks out Gardevoir and Sealeo together, and P2 sends Necrozma and Weedle into its Toxic Spikes at once. Showdown's `insertChoice` refreshes each entrant's speed with `getActionSpeed` (Trick Room inverted) as its `runSwitch` is queued, so the slower Weedle's `SwitchIn` comes first: it absorbs the Toxic Spikes and Necrozma enters unpoisoned. The engine ordered the entrants by their plain speed (R-M11-120; the R-M11-119 chain Nightly, m9-gen7doublesou-s493-012)"
